===Etymology===
Attested since 16th century as {{m|ru|мущина}}. From {{inh|ru|orv|*мѫжьщина}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*mǫžьščina}}, from {{af|sla-pro|*mǫžьskъ|*-ina|nocat=1}}, from {{af|sla-pro|*mǫžь|*-ьskъ|nocat=1}}. Equivalent to {{suffix|ru|мужско́й|ина}}.

